abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of a decision-theoretic layer built on
  top of the grain-coherence-to-Born representation theorem of
  quantum-foundations-lean: acts, consequences, refinement invariance,
  rational expectation, and Bornian calibration. Results are under
  construction; see MILESTONES.md for status. Not to be cited as
  established until milestone P11 closes.
